<title>USA: Horizon Cellular closes on cellular unit sales.</title>
<headline>Horizon Cellular closes on cellular unit sales.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon Cellular Group said on Wednesday that it has closed its sale of four cellular systems to SYGNET for $250 million.</p>
<p>The four markets have a combined population of 1.3 million, Horizon said. Proceeds from the sale will be used to fund Horizon's tender offer for its notes, the company said.</p>
</text>
